Mantella actions for [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/55653]Nether's Follower Framework[/url]: talk an NPC into your party, tell them to wait, follow, stay out of fights, or hand them clothes to wear.

[center][size=5][font=Trebuchet MS][b][color=#93c47d]ACTIONS[/color][/b][/font][/size][/center][table][tr][th]Action[/th][th]What happens[/th][/tr][tr][td]JoinParty / LeaveParty[/td][td]The NPC joins or leaves your NFF party[/td][/tr][tr][td]WaitHere / FollowMe[/td][td]Only that follower waits or follows again[/td][/tr][tr][td]EveryoneWait / EveryoneFollow[/td][td]The whole party[/td][/tr][tr][td]StayPassive / FightFreely[/td][td]Stays out of fights, or attacks enemies and helps allies[/td][/tr][tr][td]WearThis[/td][td]Opens trade; what you hand over becomes their NFF outfit for where you are[/td][/tr][/table]
[color=#888888]Every order goes through NFF itself, so NFF's menu always shows the same state. Combat style, party role, follow distance, carry torch and party loot need Mantella's Advanced Actions on; the other orders work without it.[/color]

[center][size=5][font=Trebuchet MS][b][color=#93c47d]REQUIREMENTS[/color][/b][/font][/size][/center][list]
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/196849]Mantella Living World - Integration Hub[/url][/*][*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/98631]Mantella[/url] 0.14[/*][*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/55653]Nether's Follower Framework[/url][/*][/list][center][size=5][font=Trebuchet MS][b][color=#93c47d]BEFORE YOU START[/color][/b][/font][/size][/center][list=1]
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/98631]Mantella[/url] 0.14: install it and check that a normal conversation works.[/*][*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/196214]Mantella - Direct AI Connect[/url]: install it below Mantella in MO2 and run its Setup Backend.cmd once (needs Python 3.11). Without it the stock Mantella.exe runs and Living World does nothing.[/*][*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/196849]Mantella Living World - Integration Hub[/url], then the modules you want.[/*][*]API key: your LLM service's key stays in GPT_SECRET_KEY.txt in the Mantella mod folder (in MO2, right-click Mantella, Open in Explorer). A key for another service goes in the file named on the Direct AI Connect page, next to it.[/*][*]Open Mantella's settings page (http://localhost:4999/ui in your browser, only while Mantella is running), go to the Actions tab and turn on Advanced Actions. Many Living World actions (bribe, persuade, marriage steps, positions, map marks and others) only work with it, and it needs a model that supports tool calling.[/*][*]Nothing happens? Living World Main Status in Mantella's settings page lists what is missing.[/*][/list][center][size=5][font=Trebuchet MS][b][color=#93c47d]INSTALLATION[/color][/b][/font][/size][/center][list=1]
[*]Install the hub, then this module.[/*][*]In the Mantella UI's action settings, turn off Mantella's own Follow, Unfollow and Wait.[/*][/list][center][size=5][font=Trebuchet MS][b][color=#93c47d]NOTES[/color][/b][/font][/size][/center][list]
[*]Wear this saves the outfit for where you are: adventuring, town or home (NFF's own outfit slots).[/*][*]NFF shows a one-time notice the first time an outfit is stored.[/*][/list][center][size=5][font=Trebuchet MS][b][color=#93c47d]SOURCE AND LICENSE[/color][/b][/font][/size][/center][url=https://github.com/Abhisek571/Mantella-Living-World-Followers]GitHub[/url], GNU AGPL-3.0 (Mantella is AGPL-3.0). Unofficial, not endorsed by the authors of the mods it works with.

